      <name>Intelligence Summary</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>AI Council Assessment</name>
        <styleUrl>#intel</styleUrl>
        <description>The U.S. Army has established a new Indo-Pacific Task Force, while 4 Marines are receiving medical care after an Osprey mishap. A Congressional report on U.S. aircraft combat losses in Operation Epic Fury is also mentioned. Senior military intelligence leaders from 20 nations gather in Fiji to strengthen trust and cooperation, and an exercise in excellence for 13 Iowa National Guard Soldiers is highlighted.</description>
